{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03142","headline":"登总持寺阁 · 张九龄","name":"登总持寺阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香阁起崔嵬，高高沙版开。\n攀跻千仞上，纷诡万形来。\n草间商君陌，云重汉后台。\n山从函谷断，川向斗城回。\n林里春容变，天边客思催。\n登临信爲美，怀远独悠哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}